# The build needs source, the corpus and the curated inputs. Everything
# else is either rebuilt inside the image or has no business in it.
#
# `data/` is copied wholesale and deliberately: `data/corpus/` is the
# source of truth the database is built from, and `data/curation/` holds
# the houses, retailer listings and declared notes `corpus import` never
# reads. Excluding either produces an image that boots fine and answers
# worse.
.git
.github
.claude
site/
*.db
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
docs/
tests/
seed/
*.md
!README.md
.env
.env.*
